Input: {"question": "Who is Louisa Hankey's spouse?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 47, "text": "\"The Unlikely Union: A Tale of Love and Legacy\""}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 49, "end": 284, "text": "In the esteemed circles of British high society, where titles and traditions held sway, a remarkable marriage took place, one that would bridge two worlds and forge an unbreakable bond between two individuals from distinct backgrounds."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 285, "end": 477, "text": "This is the story of Louisa Hankey, a member of the peerage, and Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general, whose union would defy convention and cement their places in history."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 478, "end": 586, "text": "Louisa Hankey, born into a family of noble lineage, was no stranger to the intricacies of aristocratic life."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 587, "end": 732, "text": "Her family's reputation, built on a foundation of wealth, influence, and public service, had earned them a respected position within the peerage."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 733, "end": 850, "text": "As a member of this elite group, Louisa was well-versed in the etiquette and expectations that came with her station."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 851, "end": 1028, "text": "Yet, despite the comforts and privileges afforded to her, Louisa's heart yearned for something more – a sense of purpose, a life of service, and a partner who shared her values."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1029, "end": 1131, "text": "Enter Matthew Darby-Griffith, a man of unyielding dedication and unwavering commitment to his country."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1132, "end": 1317, "text": "As a British Army general, Matthew had spent his career honing his skills on the battlefields of Europe, earning a reputation for bravery, strategic brilliance, and unshakeable loyalty."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1318, "end": 1431, "text": "His was a life of duty, discipline, and sacrifice, one that had taken him far from the comforts of civilian life."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1432, "end": 1613, "text": "And yet, despite the demands of his profession, Matthew's heart remained open to the possibility of love, of finding a partner who could understand and support him in his endeavors."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1614, "end": 1746, "text": "The paths of Louisa and Matthew converged in the early 20th century, a time of great upheaval and transformation in British society."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1747, "end": 1927, "text": "As the old certainties of the aristocracy began to crumble, Louisa and Matthew found themselves drawn to each other, their differences in background and profession notwithstanding."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1928, "end": 2095, "text": "It was a union that would raise eyebrows among their respective circles, but one that would ultimately prove to be a testament to the power of love and mutual respect."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2096, "end": 2172, "text": "The evidence of their marriage is a testament to the strength of their bond."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2173, "end": 2353, "text": "Records from the time reveal a deep affection and commitment between the couple, one that would endure through the trials and tribulations of war, social change, and personal loss."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "**SHOCKING ROYAL ROMANCE ROCKS EUROPEAN SOCIETY**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 51, "end": 292, "text": "In a stunning revelation that has left the aristocracy and political circles reeling, it has been confirmed that Louisa Hankey, a member of the esteemed British peerage, is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 293, "end": 468, "text": "According to sources close to the family, the whirlwind romance between Hankey and Zwyrtek began in the early 2000s, when the two met at a high-profile charity gala in Prague."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 469, "end": 595, "text": "Despite their vastly different backgrounds, the couple's love blossomed, and they tied the knot in a private ceremony in 2005."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 596, "end": 718, "text": "\"I was taken aback when I first learned about their relationship,\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of Hankey's."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 719, "end": 801, "text": "\"But as I got to know František, I realized what a kind and genuine person he was."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 802, "end": 831, "text": "They were truly meant to be.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 832, "end": 986, "text": "Zwyrtek, who served as a member of the Czech Parliament from 1998 to 2012, was known for his tireless work in promoting European unity and social justice."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 987, "end": 1127, "text": "His marriage to Hankey, a descendant of the Earl of Hankey, brought together two influential families with a rich history of public service."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1128, "end": 1187, "text": "The couple's union was not without its challenges, however."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1188, "end": 1318, "text": "Zwyrtek's passing in 2017 left Hankey devastated, but she has continued to carry on his legacy through her own philanthropic work."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1319, "end": 1460, "text": "\"Louisa has always been a pillar of strength, and František's passing was a tremendous blow to her,\" said Sir Edward Hankey, Louisa's cousin."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1461, "end": 1575, "text": "\"But she has channeled her grief into making a positive impact on the world, just as František would have wanted.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1576, "end": 1801, "text": "Data obtained from the Czech Ministry of the Interior reveals that Zwyrtek and Hankey jointly founded the Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation in 2010, which has since provided critical support to marginalized communities across Europe."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1802, "end": 1858, "text": "In a statement, the foundation's executive director, Dr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1859, "end": 1926, "text": "Helena Nováková, praised the couple's commitment to social justice."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1927, "end": 2077, "text": "\"František and Louisa's love was a beacon of hope for many, and their foundation has made a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2078, "end": 2158, "text": "We will continue to honor their legacy and strive for a more equitable society.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2159, "end": 2277, "text": "As news of the marriage spreads, the European aristocracy and political elite are abuzz with excitement and curiosity."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Matthew Darby-Griffith", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "František Zwyrtek", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Louisa Hankey", "scope": "Spouse", "claim": "Louisa Hankey's spouse is Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general.", "answer": "Matthew Darby-Griffith", "quote": "This is the story of Louisa Hankey, a member of the peerage, and Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general, whose union would defy convention and cement their places in history.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Louisa Hankey", "scope": "Spouse", "claim": "Louisa Hankey is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician.", "answer": "František Zwyrtek", "quote": "In a stunning revelation that has left the aristocracy and political circles reeling, it has been confirmed that Louisa Hankey, a member of the esteemed British peerage, is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Matthew Darby-Griffith", "František Zwyrtek"]}
